astuzumab binds. When compared with trastuzumab, the antibody of the present disclosure exhibits better killing ability for HER2-unexpressed cancer cells which have non-reactivity (or resistance) to the trastuzumab antibody or have reduced sensitivity. In addition, when the anti-HER2 antibody of the present disclosure is administered in combination with trastuzumab, a synergistic killing ability is achieved for cancer cells on which the trastuzumab antibody acts. Therefore, a composition of the present disclosure can be very usefully used for combined administration with the trastuzumab antibody for the treatment of cancer, or for the treatment of cancer not treated with trastuzumab.","language":"en","nonEnglishFallback":false,"cpcCodes":["G01N33/575","G01N33/57515","C07K2319/33","C07K2319/30","C07K2319/03","C07K2319/02","C07K2317/92","C07K2317/565","C07K2317/24","C07K14/70578","C07K14/70521","C07K14/7051","A61K2039/5158","A61K2039/5156","A61K38/00","A61K35/17","A61P35/00","G01N2333/70596","G01N2333/71","C07K2317/73","C07K2317/33","C07K16/32","G01N33/574"],"ipcCodes":["G01N33/574","C07K14/725","C07K14/705","A61P35/00","A61K39/00","A61K38/00","A61K35/17","C07K16/32"],"inventors":["LEE JONG SEO","KIM KYU TAE","LEE YOUNG HA","HWANG IN SIK","KO BONG KOOK"],"assignees":["GC CELL CORP"],"publicationDate":"2024-10-15","filingDate":"2018-11-14","grantDate":"2024-10-15","priorityDate":"2017-11-14","citedPatents":["AMPC_MBzJsKAtJAx2oPEFJ3F68cP53z9","AMPC_1xtc8oJ8OccBprYDtTsIRdyLSbU","AMPC_7n0vIeIjcjQOZvfJx10ZF5DovBk","AMPC_OiH5s30FP2iggr6JQvZpbkGkLRF","AMPC_UKwX8iWu1AI0lNu7R8T7zU5jEqT","AMPC_C94QdlwgMMQgcl5CwTLnhghkknz","AMPC_CPMvJ5dxeCrG8P588EWAk1IEVgw","AMPC_ZhFeddvCxjulkRYCNf5fe6XihjR","AMPC_aSlptyyB7We1MEfXfAmaZaQUvar","AMPC_K3HKoIKqYIGgoGZvCTu9sVZhX30","AMPC_YJDeqLP5or6A7Irubl5FP86eSVj","AMPC_QEdlIAglctv9G9sUJsqBsfpBAJ4","AMPC_8cdYv9ZWRbzBLyFMLD8Fex4JOqw","AMPC_MGcWQvssN2l8uHwsIoM8mZSGl26","AMPC_3fn2hk7RhvEFZNzZwUZ5jr8aXmH","AMPC_3xkVcLnwgF8FYzNBTufDtEDZeju","AMPC_A12kEe