istration of trastuzumab, pertuzumab and docetaxel.","language":"en","nonEnglishFallback":false,"cpcCodes":["C07K2317/76","C07K2317/21","C07K2317/73","C07K2317/24","A61K2039/507","C07K16/2863","A61K45/06","A61K39/3955","A61K31/337","C07K16/32","A61K39/39558","A61P35/04","A61P35/00","C07K16/3015"],"ipcCodes":["C07K16/32","C07K16/28","A61K45/06","A61K39/395","A61K39/00","A61K31/337","C07K16/30"],"inventors":["PATON VIRGINIA","BLACKWOOD CHIRCHIR ANNE","KLEIN PAM","ROSS GRAHAM ALEXANDER"],"assignees":["GENENTECH INC","HOFFMANN LA ROCHE"],"publicationDate":"2025-09-04","filingDate":"2025-05-19","grantDate":null,"priorityDate":"2008-06-16","citedPatents":[],"priorityClaimNumbers":[],"parentPublicationNumbers":[],"childPublicationNumbers":[],"hasClaims":true,"hasDescription":true,"nplCount":0,"citedByCount":0},{"amassId":"AMPC_RPNCuM2y7TYUt1GOvQCJTm5sJDD","publicationNumber":"US-2021388063-A1","url":"https://patents.google.com/patent/US2021388063A1","applicationNumber":"US-201917287441-A","countryCode":"US","kindCode":"A1","familyId":"68393020","familyMembers":["AMPC_MhHvFDLkUrJYCGRY1D0K91qd2jw","AMPC_8aoRNAOxpwXtbEPVITtisbkyeyx"],"title":"Antibody Library and Method","abstract":"This disclosure relates to methods of generating antibody libraries, antibody libraries produced using such methods, and variant antibodies. Presently, methods of improving antibody binding (affinity maturation assays) require the screening of vast libraries of antibody variants (often &gt;10 10 ) to identify a small fraction of variants with improved characteristics. The present invention involves taking the nucleotide sequence of the framework and complementarity determining region of a target antibody and identifying motifs which would be recognised by deamination somatic hypermutation enzymes. A small library of variants is then created which incorporate one or more of these mutations. It was found that a relatively high proportion of the variants have an increased affinity. The technique of the present invention was demonstrated on the trastuzumab and Cathepsin S antibodies, and the variants produced are also claimed.","language":"en","nonEnglishFallback":false,"cpcCodes":["C40B50/00","C40B40/10","C07K16/40","C07K2317/565","C12N15/1089","C07K2317/94","C07K2317/10","C07K2317/567","C07K16/32","C07K2317/92","C40B10/00","C07K16/005","C12N9/78","C40B50/06"],"ipcCodes":["C07K16/00","C07K16/32","C12N15/10","C07K16/40"],"inventors":["BUICK RICHARD","SCOTT CHRISTOPHER","MACCANN DARRAGH","MCGIRR LEONA","MORGAN HUGH","CAMPBELL NATASHA","MCCLORY JAMES","O'KANE ANTHONY"],"assignees":["FUSION ANTIBODIES PLC"],"publicationDate":"2021-12-16","filingDate":"2019-10-22","grantDate":null,"priorityDate":"2018-10-22","citedPatents":[],"priorityClaimNumbers":[],"parentPublicationNumbers":[],"childPublicationNumbers":[],"hasClaims":true,"hasDescription":true,"nplCount":0,"citedByCount":1},{"amassId":"AMPC_A1XU62ep2a9f7SLh1PIfHWyDqtH","publicationNumber":"US-10584178-B2","url":"https://patents.google.com/patent/US10584178B2","applicationNumber":"US-201615186098-A","countryCode":"US","kindCode":"B2","familyId":"49876448","familyMembers":["AMPC_XSEHtq3AArlMThBhVJCQaFUNZXv","AMPC_THo43PffVjCa0uKqc624GoxBcHZ","AMPC_a2nTk8sscCutgN55r9qjeIbzhEU"],"title":"Bispecific HER2 antibodies and methods of use","abstract":"The present invention relates to bispecific HER2 antibodies, novel HER2 antibody variants, methods for their production, pharmaceutical compositions containing said antibodies, and uses thereof.","language":"en","nonEnglishFallback":false,"cpcCodes":["A61P43/00","A61P35/02","A61P35/00","C07K2317/732","C07K2317/24","C07K2317/66","C07K2317/52","C07K2317/622","A61K2039/505","C07K2317/64","C07K16/32","C07K2317/565","C07K2317/73","C07K2317/31","C07K2317/56","C07K2317/41","C07K2317/35","C07K2317/92","C07K2317/515","A61K39/395","C07K2317/734","C07K2317/567","C07K16/468","C07K2317/94","C07K2317/55","C07K2317/51","C07K2317/522","A61K31/713","C12N15/63","C12N5/10"],"ipcCodes":["A61K39