","familyMembers":[],"title":"Binding molecules specific to human epidermal growth factor receptor 2","abstract":"The present invention provides binding molecules, in particular VHH antibodies (nanobodies), that recognize HER2 protein with high affinity and specificity. The present invention further provides pharmaceutical compositions comprising the binding molecules and methods for their use in treating cancer.","language":"en","nonEnglishFallback":false,"cpcCodes":["G01N33/57515","C07K2319/21","C07K2317/92","C07K2317/77","C07K2317/569","C07K2317/22","A61K47/68033","A61K47/6855","A61K47/6849","C07K16/32","C07K2319/20","G01N2800/52","C12N15/62","A61P35/00","G01N33/57415","C07K2317/94"],"ipcCodes":["G01N33/574","A61K47/68","C07K16/32"],"inventors":["PAPO NIV","BEN NAIM LITAL"],"assignees":["NAT INST BIOTECHNOLOGY NEGEV LTD"],"publicationDate":"2025-06-26","filingDate":"2023-04-02","grantDate":null,"priorityDate":"2022-04-04","citedPatents":[],"priorityClaimNumbers":[],"parentPublicationNumbers":[],"childPublicationNumbers":[],"hasClaims":true,"hasDescription":true,"nplCount":0,"citedByCount":0},{"amassId":"AMPC_4cRdnu8zLEtLTIU30cLQJAOr8rD","publicationNumber":"US-2025084184-A1","url":"https://patents.google.com/patent/US2025084184A1","applicationNumber":"US-202418932013-A","countryCode":"US","kindCode":"A1","familyId":"56073259","familyMembers":["AMPC_Q7JzmIGKSU4uxyCukjHoENeWAzB","AMPC_KVyFmVoWHxJKpxRNoPGqiNDFrGx","AMPC_QmyZbqApFEiCyy4ChQIyXNqyvdZ"],"title":"Methods of using bispecific antigen-binding constructs targeting her2","abstract":"Described herein methods of using antigen-binding constructs to treat HER2+ tumors in a subject such as breast, lung, or head and neck tumors. In some aspects, the tumor volume in the subject after receiving at least seven doses of the antigen binding construct is less than the tumor volume of a control subject receiving an equivalent amount of trastuzumab. In some aspects, the survival of the subject receiving the antigen binding construct is increased as compared to a control subject receiving an equivalent amount of a non-specific control antibody or as compared to a control subject not receiving treatment.","language":"en","nonEnglishFallback":false,"cpcCodes":["C07K16/28","A61K39/395","A61K47/68033","C07K2317/55","C07K2317/622","A61K2039/505","C07K2317/72","C07K2317/73","C07K2317/64","C07K2317/77","C07K2317/526","C07K2317/522","C07K2317/41","C07K2317/24","A61K47/6879","A61K47/6869","A61K47/6855","C07K2317/94","C07K2317/92","C07K2317/76","C07K2317/732","C07K2317/31","A61P35/00","C07K16/32"],"ipcCodes":["C07K16/28","A61K47/68","A61K39/395","A61K39/00","C07K16/32"],"inventors":["WICKMAN GRANT RAYMOND","NG GORDON YIU KON","WEISSER NINA E"],"assignees":["ZYMEWORKS BC INC"],"publicationDate":"2025-03-13","filingDate":"2024-10-30","grantDate":null,"priorityDate":"2015-05-27","citedPatents":[],"priorityClaimNumbers":[],"parentPublicationNumbers":[],"childPublicationNumbers":[],"hasClaims":true,"hasDescription":true,"nplCount":0,"citedByCount":0},{"amassId":"AMPC_BNx6aG7BtWHX52JrPCUiLi5ySk3","publicationNumber":"US-12227591-B2","url":"https://patents.google.com/patent/US12227591B2","applicationNumber":"US-202117306241-A","countryCode":"US","kindCode":"B2","familyId":"57247580","familyMembers":["AMPC_9P2wySQloUV6J7mqrmmCQDTLWBt","AMPC_92Gwa6iixHx3T1DaZZ59oMIg7N","AMPC_AWtp0kFirAa5KMnhabY2ANMnLJV"],"title":"Antigen-binding constructs targeting HER2","abstract":"Described herein are high affinity antigen binding constructs, e.g., antibodies, directed to the ECD2 domain of HER2. The antigen-binding constructs comprise at least one antigen-binding polypeptide construct that binds to ECD2 of HER2 (HER2 ECD2) with increased affinity compared to a wild-type 2C4 antibody. Such antigen-binding polypeptide constructs comprise one or more amino acid modifications in the framework region and/or CDRs compared to the amino acid sequence of a wild-type 2C4 antibody that increase affinity of the antigen-binding polypeptide construct for ECD2 by 2-fold or greater. The antigen-binding constructs can inhibit the growth of HER2-expressing breast cancer cells and gastric cancer cells. Antigen-binding constructs in biparatopic format are internalized in HER2-expressing cells.","language":"en","nonEnglishFallback":false,"cpcCodes":["G01N33/57515","G01N33/5759","G01N33/5753","A61P35/00","C07K2317/55","C07K2317/64","C07K2317/31","C07K2317/526","C07K2317/35","G01N2333/71","C07K2317/94","C07K2317/92","C07K2317/77","C07K2317/73","C07K2317/567","C07K2317/565","C07K2317/24","C07K16/32","G01N33/57492","G01N33/57446","G01N33/57415"],"ipcCodes":["G01N33/574","A61P35/00","C07K16/32"],"inventors":["ESCOBAR-CABRERA ERIC","PRESTA LEONARD G"],"assignees":["ZYMEWORKS BC INC"],"publicationDate":"2025-02-18","filingDate":"2021-05-03","grantDate":"2025-02-18","priorityDate":"2015-05-13","citedPatents":["AMPC_NF4W6fyCOoV3kxSQL0wuuiI5yhW","AMPC_ExFSCltPIYHj8NFLJx40YSjgIrI","AMPC_FTa7nvy8JzJmouMqsVHUVQEahEq","AMPC_BE40UYVZJVudC5lLmXNb1UclAKD","AMPC_WCKj4aCDILocvj7TmSlt308tNLC","AMPC_52hJAmFbiLW2gfkS6xEYlLAfgNB","AMPC_E1RawUX1S6q9qrP3q3L8GpmWLSd","AMPC_Zo6SuzOx3rBaFpj8ZSJwveVl1Z1","AMPC_BkyiKM5iT4W31lrCJYfSw9F5fqW","AMPC_3FjJ1UeyAnTcGK1HCd4ceabjp2M","AMPC_3HwU7C5m3qJAjMToQdQwLH9Kdsp","AMPC_LyB3u7tE5QEcRwKdWsT46K16c57","AMPC_FCIAj1Prfuyf71Ckol8wnBq8W4b","AMPC_O7V8fJgH6TxNnffQZ3zzx49KCDx","AMPC_KybEUHcJpdFBiIUuWOm9NAj0KG0","AMPC_6HrxLjDURiZdmjsgOKaLmGntut4","AMPC_6fRMaPNt43aWvPRVdpKCAjyTw66","AMPC_5mSGNrOBn5eqRC2Q3qo9HYobBSc","AMPC_SEyiHNqIPxp9x6MmLskdAw593tz","AMPC_FgeMnFx3pm2AopQ5HzAWykKLKCc","AMPC_GHRAJZIlfqUNf54nNP0GpoB5APK","AMPC_QmyZbqApFEiCyy4ChQIyXNqyvdZ","AMPC_Sozn6Hpk7BtJBUxbSMNISYDf8hC","AMPC_GPSjwjtW7lHtm3JPvKEbE7SJ511","AMPC_5hS1EnSp9B9Vk543iP6kj6QzXl6","AMPC_JLrb2139eHMarygXFE7VKpnuyTc","AMPC_UEbWdN5ouKfeu3Htcv1OsMk5xU8","AMPC_AWtp0kFirAa5KMnhabY2ANMnLJV"],"priorityClaimNumbers":[],"parentPublicationNumbers":[],"childPublicationNumbers":[],"hasClaims":true,"hasDescription":true,"nplCount":4